WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.400
<i>I kissed Mamiya.</i>

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.740
I was nervous.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:17.120
Ah, she's so cute!

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:19.730
Fuyuki.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:21.670
What?

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.330
Dinner's ready.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:25.830
I'll be right down.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:27.890
Shun, I love you!

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:28.770
What?

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.440
Um, okay...

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.260
We're having tonkatsu tonight.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.130
I love tonkatsu!

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.700
<i>As a brother who's only slightly older,</i>

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.890
<i>I'm constantly worried, perhaps a little too much,</i>

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:46.320
<i>that my brother will lose, break,</i>

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.740
<i>or hurt the things he loves.</i>

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:17.670
Here.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:20.010
Thanks.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.480
Sure is perfect Sunday weather today.

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:26.910
What kind of weather is that?

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.670
Ouch, hot...

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.390
Why are you cooling your 
fingers on my earlobe?

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.210
Because it's close by.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.630
Really?

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:41.180
I didn't realize it was closer 
than your own earlobe.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:43.860
What?

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:46.420
Yuta, your earlobes are soft.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:50.440
Most people's earlobes are soft.

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:54.200
They say that people with soft 
earlobes are perverts.

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:57.550
Really?

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:02.240
Yeah. Which means most people are perverts.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.980
What are we going to do if 
Shun's earlobes are soft?

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:09.160
<b>Incoming Call...
Matsuoka Shun</b>

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.160
Speak of the devil.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:11.550
Hello?

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:14.270
Hello?

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:20.100
Yuta-kun, what am I going to do?

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:21.470
Shun?

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:27.790
Wh-What should I do? Fuyuki... Fuyuki...

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.470
What's going on?

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:33.010
I'm not sure, but apparently...

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:35.020
something really bad has 
happened to Shun's brother.

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.100
What does that have to do with me?

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:40.070
Are you okay, Shun-chan?

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:43.350
Was it Fuyuki?

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:45.560
Did that pervert bully you?

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:47.900
That bastard!

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:48.780
You stay here!

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:50.750
I'll go beat him up for you!

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:51.830
Hold your horses. That's not it.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.370
What is it, then?

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:56.380
Fuyuki...

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:58.590
Fuyuki...

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.240
...<i>kissed</i> Mamiya-san.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.940
What? That's all?

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:10.290
"That's all"? Don't you 
think it's too soon?

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.270
They're only second years!

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:16.650
They're not <i>that</i> young.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:19.920
I don't know what to say to 
him as his older brother.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:23.490
Okay... can I go now?

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:27.680
Shun, have you seen my phone?

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:34.680
I see you're all doing nothing 
on your day off, as usual.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:35.940
Shut up.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:39.150
You're the one who created this situation...

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:40.630
by kissing your little girlfriend.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.260
Huh? Oh.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.660
So, what?

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:48.260
One little kiss is nothing 
to get so worked up about.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.100
Where's my phone?

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.740
Where'd it go?

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:58.280
Shun asked me about it, 
so I had to tell him.

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:02.010
Of course we kissed.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.520
We're dating, after all.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.700
Whoops, this is the remote.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:12.340
Hey, it was only a kiss. 
You should let it go.

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:14.990
He's acting like an idiot.

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:17.700
<i>Just</i> a kiss?

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:22.850
Kissing isn't the only thing lovers do.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.670
Kyoko, I love you.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.530
I won't let you leave tonight.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.260
Satoru.

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:34.100
No, Satoru. The stars are watching.

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:37.120
I don't care.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:42.230
Hey, you lech.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.280
What? Don't you ever shut up?

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.290
Don't give me that.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:49.770
You've become a fully-fledged 
pervert over one little kiss.

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:52.300
Middle schoolers shouldn't 
go any further than kissing!

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:55.660
What? Is there a law against it?

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.190
You idiot!

00:05:57.190 --> 00:06:00.530
Even if the law allows it, 
my pride never will!

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:01.430
Okay, okay.

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:04.020
Must be tough having no
 luck with the ladies...

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:06.010
even though you're in high school.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.430
You bastard, don't think you've won...

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:09.350
Now, now.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.880
just because you have a girlfriend!

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:13.400
You lost the moment you picked a 
serious fight with a middle schooler.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:14.890
Hey, Big Brother Shun!

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.930
Listen to what your little brother's saying.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.430
What are you thinking?

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.830
Middle schoolers should study 
together, support each other,

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.030
and build up friendships like that.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.320
Listen to what Mother Shun's saying.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:29.840
Shun-chan.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:32.090
In any case, as long as you're a student,

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.150
you're still far too young.

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:36.390
I don't know about that.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:36.950
What?

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.360
Between a third and half of all people...

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:41.800
have had their first experience by high school.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:42.540
What?

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:45.630
Huh? What? Wh-Where does it say that?

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:46.910
Where? Where?

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:51.100
Seriously? That's kinda depressing.

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:52.690
Shun, did you buy this?

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:54.220
No, my sister did.

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:57.300
But half is amazingly high.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.050
That's one in every two people.

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:01.650
Kanamecchi?!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.590
I knew it.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:07.130
Valedictorians aren't prestigious, 
they're perverts.

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:08.610
Why me?

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:12.590
Just how closely are you trying 
to look with those glasses?

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:14.950
Do you keep them 
on when you're doing it?

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.670
Are you all braindead?

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:20.790
Half of all people have their 
first kiss by high school.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:28.840
"First experience" doesn't mean 
your first kiss. It means s—

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.720
Where are you going, Fuyuki?

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:34.390
Damn, thought that was my chance to escape.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.120
I'm not done talking to you.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:38.750
Haven't you said enough already?

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:41.380
I've got a date with Mamiya today.

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:42.670
What?

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:46.470
I'm sure you don't need telling, 
but don't try anything, okay?

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:48.760
Make sure you stay out 
of your girlfriend's room...

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.930
and don't go to hotels or places like that.

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:52.400
I know.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.040
Matsuoka.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.170
Mamiya.

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:05.780
Sorry I'm late.

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:08.000
It's fine. I just got here, too.

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:13.000
Let's go.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:13.890
Okay.

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:15.930
"I just got here, too."

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:19.430
That's the first time I've 
actually heard anyone say that.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.430
It's the first time I've 
heard it in real life, too.

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:25.390
Who are you trying to impress?

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:27.520
He's not trying to impress anyone.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.050
We came here to watch him.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:31.190
Who wouldn't?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:34.030
We've got to make sure that pervert,

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:37.660
in the grips of puberty, 
doesn't cross the line.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:40.660
If adults like us don't do it, who will?

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.780
No one.

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:46.300
They seem to be having fun.

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:49.960
Yes, well...

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:54.470
I find this sort of 
thing very interesting.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:59.470
I'm here because I'm genuinely worried 
about Fuyuki and Mamiya-san.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.940
But the rest of you...

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:05.190
The rest of you are all 
thinking dirty thoughts!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:06.020
Sheesh!

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:07.900
Sorry.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.110
Hey, what does that mean?

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.490
Shut up and watch.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:31.970
Go now.

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:35.530
Shout it out.

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:38.860
To protect our blue earth.

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:42.010
To shed the light of hope.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.760
Go! Go!

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:48.440
Everyone's a Homa Ranger.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:53.630
Today, someone out there is a Homa Ranger.

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:54.790
All together.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:58.630
Homa Ranger, yeah!

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:00.280
Homa Rangers are the best.

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:03.960
What?! 61?!

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:05.190
See?

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.500
It's your fault for trying a song 
you only know the chorus to.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:11.030
It's my fault?

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:12.250
You got it.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.170
You lost a whole load of points 
because of that hairdo.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.070
My hair's got nothing to do with it.

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:19.530
Shun, do you want to 
sing something with me?

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:24.410
Oh, no. I'm not very good at singing.

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:25.430
Sing something.

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:28.690
Otherwise, Chizuru will 
take the stage again.

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.740
What do you want to do?

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:34.600
In that case...

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:41.880
When the flowers are dancing 
and everyone's smiling...

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:45.680
then it's all right, 
and even I'll be happy.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.490
Shun-chan's amazing.

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:50.870
Yeah, he's so off, 
he's almost harmonizing.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:52.850
That doesn't make any sense.

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:55.820
Kanamecchi, you sing something next.

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.920
What? I'll pass.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.680
We'll pull up something you can sing.

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:03.180
Come on, take the mic.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:06.670
He looks like he's running for office.

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:09.180
Huh? Kaname, did you 
declare your candidacy?

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:11.690
What?

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:18.120
Not my fault, not my fault.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:21.220
It's not my fault.

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:28.710
Those of you who got caught up in this...

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:33.240
I'm not interested. Simply not interested.

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:36.420
Why won't you leave me alone...

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:45.810
when you're the one who told me to leave?

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:57.460
Every honor student has to work...

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:02.490
I don't know the rest, so whoever 
wants to sing can finish.

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:04.910
Kaname-kun, that was amazing.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:08.530
I can't believe you sang it normally.

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:12.110
You're supposed to go 
flamboyant. <i>Really</i> flamboyant.

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:15.160
Well, there's nothing funnier 
than Tsukahara Kaname...

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:17.130
being a decent singer.

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:20.120
Shut up already.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:23.610
Anyway, karaoke's all we've 
been doing for a while now.

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:25.580
Don't you care about Fuyuki anymore?

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:28.590
They haven't got up to anything yet,

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:32.160
and it seems like they're just 
singing over in the next room.

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:34.400
I think I might have been 
worrying over nothing.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:40.270
We shouldn't have followed 
them on their date.

00:12:40.270 --> 00:12:42.430
Don't sweat it, Shun-chan.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:45.160
They don't know we followed them.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:49.800
Okay, let's sing a whole 
load more songs today!

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:11.590
The room next door sounds lively.

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:14.770
I wonder if it's a group of little kids.

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:19.650
Yeah, I get the feeling it's a group of guys 
who have the same mental age as kids.

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:22.070
Let's sing some more, too.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:26.270
Isn't this one on TV all the time?

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:30.330
Oh, right.

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:33.350
Here, happy birthday.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:36.870
Huh? How did you...

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:40.330
Did I tell you when my birthday was?

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:42.380
I asked your friends.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:44.110
Really?

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:45.440
Can I open it?

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:46.440
Yeah.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:49.890
It's so cute.

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:53.310
Thanks, Matsuoka.

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:55.770
Oh, wait.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.180
What about you, Matsuoka?

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:58.480
When's your birthday?

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.800
Mine's December 30th.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.040
I see.

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.560
So you've already had it.

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:08.450
I'll still get you a present, anyway.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:10.400
You don't need to do that.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:12.830
That's not why I gave you one.

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:15.880
I want to give you something.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.250
Tell me, what do you want?

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:23.620
Matsuoka?

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.240
Um, well...

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.990
Can I touch your chest?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.230
What?

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:52.760
M-Mine?

00:14:55.340 --> 00:15:01.380
B-But my chest is... um, small...

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:05.880
It's not that I want to fondle 
big ones or anything...

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:18.700
G-Go ahead.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.410
What? Really?

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:25.190
Yeah. As long as it's over my clothes.

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.900
Okay. Then...

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:34.030
There.

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:38.240
They're soft.

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:45.770
Your earlobes.

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:46.630
What?

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:49.510
Shun, yours are soft, too.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:53.040
Is it bad to have soft earlobes?

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:56.060
I wouldn't say it's bad exactly.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:57.780
Right, Yuta-kun?

00:15:58.590 --> 00:15:59.430
Yuta?

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.810
What's wrong, Yutan?

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.940
It's too early for a break.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:06.120
I just...

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:12.580
I just thought that it wouldn't be 
impossible to do it in a karaoke booth.

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:14.110
Huh? Not impossible to do what?

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.950
Oh, that again?

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.620
I guess it's not impossible...

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:25.380
Yeah, even a karaoke booth could work.

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:28.380
Hey, guys.

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:33.910
You're always trying to 
pin something on him.

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:36.180
They're not doing anything. 
I'm sure they're just fine.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.510
You're right.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:40.940
A karaoke booth's a triple 
threat: It's locked,

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:43.120
soundproofed, and has soft couches.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:44.650
I didn't even think about that.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:47.480
How long did they say 
they were using the room for?

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.400
Didn't they ask for an hour to start?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:53.780
What? Is an hour a 
long time? Or is it short?

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:56.150
I don't know.

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:58.170
It wouldn't be impossible.

00:16:58.170 --> 00:17:00.240
It's possible to request an 
extension in some cases, too.

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:06.000
I haven't heard any singing coming 
from that room for a while.

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:10.450
Fuyuki!

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:12.120
Calm down, Shun-chan!

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:16.010
Fuyuki, why are you always 
doing things that make me sad?

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:13.830
It'll be okay!

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:16.010
Where did that come from?

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:23.250
<i>Wh-What am I going to do?</i>

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:25.990
<i>I didn't think about what would 
happen after I touched them.</i>

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.530
S-Sorry.

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:42.040
I'm sorry, Mamiya. Sorry.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.540
Sorry.

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:06.270
<i>I didn't mean to cry.</i>

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.080
<i>I turned this into a bad 
experience for Matsuoka...</i>

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:11.030
<i>by making him apologize so much.</i>

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.840
Sorry I took so long, Matsuoka—

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:24.870
Huh? I'm sorry, I'm in the wrong room.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.540
Mamiya-san.

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.540
Matsuoka's brother.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.450
It's nice to see you again.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.500
I see you've come here 
to have some fun, too.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:34.250
Oh.

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:36.890
U-Um...

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:44.030
Mamiya-san, have you been crying?

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:44.770
What?

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:52.900
Um, Mamiya, I'm sorry about what...

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:55.440
Fuyuki...

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:56.900
Shun?

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.010
You idiot!

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:00.410
That was close!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.930
What was that for?

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:05.430
You made Mamiya-san cry!

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:06.710
Shut up.

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:09.300
I wasn't trying to make her cry.

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:11.230
This has got nothing to do with you.

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:12.210
It does!

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.130
Why?

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.960
I'm your brother!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:18.420
Sh-Shun-chan, you should get 
the full story from...

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:20.860
I don't care what happened.

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:22.850
Why would you make the 
girl you love cry?

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:24.600
Why can't you take care of her properly?

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:30.370
You were acting so happy every day 
just because you'd kissed Mamiya-san.

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:34.280
Um, sir?

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:37.120
Oh, it's nothing. Nothing.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:39.640
Right, guys? We're just 
friends doing a spot of karaoke...

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:40.610
But you...

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:45.270
But, Fuyuki, you're always looking 
at dirty magazines and videos!

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:50.020
Whenever you get into trouble, 
you hide them under my bed!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:50.870
We get it.

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:51.980
We get it, Shun-chan.

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:53.460
Okay? Come on.

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:04.560
<i>My brother always accepts 
that I worry too much.</i>

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:10.480
<i>It's as inevitable as the breath of spring 
melting the cold of winter.</i>

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.020
It's cold, isn't it?

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.750
You're so lucky, Matsuoka.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.740
Your scarf looks warm.

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.160
Hey.

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.330
Sorry about today.

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:33.260
I'm sorry for what I did.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:38.400
But I really didn't mean to hurt you.

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:41.920
I just... well...

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:48.880
Your earlobes are soft.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.190
Pervert.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.540
I'll walk you home.

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:03.480
Okay.

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:05.010
I had fun today.

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:09.950
Why did you just let go of my hand?

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:12.580
Huh? Oh, no reason.

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:16.710
Jeez, you don't even know what should 
embarrass you and what shouldn't.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:19.870
I didn't say I was embarrassed.

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:21.960
Then, why did you let go?

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:26.970
Yutan, Shun-chan. Let's go home.

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:30.100
How has the pervert been getting on?

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:32.930
Are Fuyuki and Mamiya-san getting along?

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:36.100
Yes, thanks for asking.

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:37.990
They studied together today.

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:41.700
It looks like they're going to 
work on their friendship first.

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:43.490
As his brother, I'm relieved.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.010
Oh, really?

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:50.520
As a fellow man, I'm starting 
to worry about you, Shun.

00:21:50.520 --> 00:21:52.120
Studying, huh?

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:54.390
I wonder what they're studying.

00:21:54.390 --> 00:21:57.460
I don't think Fuyuki will 
learn his lesson that easily.

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.620
That's not true.

00:21:59.620 --> 00:22:02.590
They said they were 
studying together today, too.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:04.770
Mamiya-san's parents aren't home today,

00:22:04.770 --> 00:22:06.300
so they can study in 
her room, undisturbed.

00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:08.990
In Mamiya-san's room?

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:10.070
Yes.

00:22:10.070 --> 00:22:12.260
In Mamiya-san's room, which has a bed?

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:13.310
Yes.

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:15.550
Just the two of them?

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:21.510
Fuyuki!

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:23.550
This looks like trouble.

00:22:23.550 --> 00:22:27.610
Could it be? 
Could it really be this time?

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:30.620
You call it "trouble," but you're smiling.

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:35.010
We can't help it. We're boys.

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:42.770
Us Boys

00:24:17.080 --> 00:24:19.980
The next episode is "Mix Juice."
